30368	Q0	zis50	27	1.0489472	instruments_tools	The questionnaire records the tendency towards self monitoring. In addition to an overall value the four subscales Acting Extraversion Other Directedness and Sensitivity for expressive behavior and social cues are mapped. The development of the scale is based on the work of Snyder 1974 .
30368	Q0	zis178	28	1.0489472	instruments_tools	The scale measures the awareness of consequences of action on a global level with three items. This corresponds to the degree of awareness of the consequences of one s own actions for global environmental changes. The development of the scale is based on the works of Schwartz 1977 1981 .
