67689	Q0	gml-12	2	2.334008	instruments_tools	For a number of questions the Microcensus 1995 contains so called derived variables on information in the context of households and families. A prerequisite for the own construction of such derived variables are identifiers IDs of the household and the family as well as the correct consideration of the respective population definition. This paper gives a brief description of such concepts and definitions and examples for SPSS.
