2272	Q0	zis199	12	1.7140732	instruments_tools	The scale measures youth activities in the social spaces of streets squares and parks. It consists of the dimensions occupation Deviante activities coping with everyday life coping with the future opportunities for contact and opportunities for development .
2272	Q0	zis35	13	1.6050682	instruments_tools	The ASKU is an economic instrument for recording individual competence expectations to be able to deal with difficulties and obstacles in daily life. The reported evidence on the quality of the ASKU suggests that the scale allows a reliable valid and economic assessment of subjective competence expectations in social science research.
